Transitive dependencies
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The resolved runtime set in requirements.txt contains about 100 packages. Their licenses are
permissive (Apache-2.0, MIT, BSD, ISC, PSF-2.0, MIT-CMU, 0BSD, Zlib, CC0-1.0), except that
three packages contain MPL-2.0 (weak copyleft) code: certifi (MPL-2.0), orjson
(MPL-2.0 AND (Apache-2.0 OR MIT)) and tqdm (MPL-2.0 AND MIT). They are used unmodified.
No GPL, LGPL or AGPL licensed packages are included.

