Third-party model APIs (configured by the user in litellm/config.yaml)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The sample's default configuration references DeepSeek and Alibaba Cloud Model Studio (DashScope)
APIs. Using them requires your own account and is subject to each provider's terms of service.
